## Key Features of This Solution

✅ **Type-safe DTOs** with validation  
✅ **Flexible query builder** supporting complex joins  
✅ **Aggregation support** for analytics  
✅ **Proper error handling** and validation  
✅ **Async query execution** for better performance  
✅ **Clean architecture** with separation of concerns  
✅ **Production-ready logging** and monitoring  
✅ **Extensible design** for adding new features  

This architecture provides a solid foundation for building complex Elasticsearch queries with Siren joins while maintaining clean, testable, and maintainable code.

